    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WannaMine</h2> - not so long ago we were plagued with the virus &quot;Virus Petya&quot; and &quot;WannaCry&quot;, but there is a new virus called &quot;WannaMine&quot;. This virus loads the CPU(Central processor) and produces cryptocurrency to the attacker.<br>In this game you have to control the virus so he could get around the firewall of computer &quot;firewall&quot; and get directly to the CPU! A winding path makes the game fun and not easy.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br> - Based on real events<br> - Original soundtrack<br> - The game difficulty increases in ascending order<br> - 18 different levels to pass",
